---
const brands = [
  "Benjamin Moore",
  "Farrow & Ball",
  "Little Greene",
  "COAT",
  "Crown",
  "Dulux",
  "Paint & Paper Library",
  "Zinsser",
];
---

<section class="bg-cream-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-olive-600">Paints We Use</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Materials We <span class="text-olive-600">Trust</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700/80">
        We work with a range of trade and premium paint brands, choosing whichever suits the job and the finish you're after. Benjamin Moore has become one of our go-to paints for its depth of colour and quality of finish — it costs a little more than some alternatives, but in our experience it's well worth considering for the right room or project.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      {brands.map((b) => (
        <span class="rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 font-display text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 shadow-sm">
          {b}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
